@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "SFR007: Request Investment Opportunity Analysis from AI Component" as SFR007
  usecase "AIFR004: Generate Investment Opportunity Analyses Based on Risk Profiles" as AIFR004

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data in a comprehensive format.
  
  SysAdmin -> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters for the AI system to ensure accuracy and compliance.

  FAFR003 <|-- (CFR002) : Financial Advisor views client intervention alerts when needed. 
                          'Client Intervention Alerts are part of FAFR003 use case, which is a System Administrator action.'
  
  SFR007 --> AIFR004 : Request investment opportunity analysis from AI component.
                        'SFR007 (system) requests the generation based on user input or system conditions.'

  Client -> CFR009 : Access consolidated financial information in one view.

  SysAdmin -> SAFR006 : Manage spending limit alerts when thresholds are exceeded. 

  FAFR002 <|-- (CFR010) : Financial Advisor manages client relationships, including data sharing and permissions.
                          'Client Relationship Management is part of FAFR002 use case for the System Administrator.'
  
  Client -> CFR003 : View financial predictions based on historical data and market trends.

  Client -> AIFR001 : Receive personalized recommendations aligned with their profile. 

  SysAdmin --> SAFR005 : Request spending limit alerts from AI component when thresholds are exceeded.
                          'SysAdmin sets up or adjusts the threshold rules.'
  
  SFR008 --> AIFR006 : Generate anomaly transaction alerts based on user data.

  Client -> CFR011 : Send feedback to improve system outputs. 

  FAFR004 <|-- (CFR007) : Financial Advisor views predictive analytics about clients' financial situations during consultations.
                          'Predictive Analytics for Clients is a part of the Financial Advisor use case.'
  
  SysAdmin -> SAFR015 : Request predictive intervention analyses from AI component to identify when advisors should engage with clients.

  Client --> CFR008 : View news related to their investment portfolio. 

  FAFR003 <|-- (CFR004) : Financial Advisor receives personalized recommendations for clients.
                          'Personalized Recommendations are part of the Financial Advisor use case.'
  
}

@enduml